WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.309
Griffiths' positivity conjecture fails.

2
00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:05.621
Griffiths asked if ample bundles always carry

3
00:00:05.621 --> 00:00:08.342
positively curved metrics. True for line bundles.

4
00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:11.293
Pull back by higher and higher power

5
00:00:11.293 --> 00:00:13.686
maps; ampleness lasts, but curvature eventually fails.

6
00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:17.117
Claimed: ample bundles with no positive metric.

7
00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:19.168
Main theorem Lean-checked.
